VALUES ('8ffc4853-b01b-511b-9014-39d5d6a9e176', '2026-W39', 'equities', 'S&P FOMC-shelf FTR long (FTR, HTF)', 'FTR, HTF', 7500, 7560, 7450, 'below', 7800, 3.4, NULL, 'on a retest of the Sep 16 low, gated on HY under 292 bps and breadth not below 45% on the entry close', 'af97a882-21e3-5638-8c4a-f5a1e020cd56', (SELECT id FROM macro_core.series WHERE key = 'spx_cash'), 'S&P FOMC-shelf FTR long (FTR, HTF): Entry 7,500–7,560 on a retest of the Sep 16 low, gated on HY under 292 bps and breadth not printing below 45% on the entry close · Invalidation 7,450 close-below · Target 7,800 · R:R ~3.4:1 · 15 - Ray Trading Blueprint. Sits under the HOLD row. The gate is deliberately credit-and-floor rather than breadth-above-55%, because a rising-breadth clause on a falling-price entry is self-contradicting and blocked this setup in three consecutive weeks.', 'active', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-21T00:00:00Z', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-21T00:00:00Z', NULL)
